# Docker build context for docker/Dockerfile (context: .. — repo root).
# Keeps the context small and, more importantly, stops host-built artifacts
# (Windows/mac node_modules, dist) from being COPYed over what `npm ci` and
# `npm run build` produce *inside* the container (see COPY server/ / COPY web/
# in docker/Dockerfile — without this, host dist/node_modules would clobber
# the container-built ones).
#
# Everything the build actually needs stays included: package.json files,
# tsconfig.base.json, scripts/, minigames/ (incl. schema.json), server/, web/ —
# see docker/Dockerfile for the exact COPY list.

.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
data
artifacts
**/dist
.env
.env.local
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
